+# rev0849 authorized-snapshot / HTML-rights / metadata-read hardening
+
+Created: 2026-06-13T14:21:00Z
+
+## Substantive changes
+
+- `scripts/publish_queue_item.py` now treats each public-surface snapshot `entry_point` as publication content requiring explicit queue-decision authorization. Decisions can still include the source manifest path, but extra snapshot entry payloads not listed in `decision.public_paths` fail closed.
+- `scripts/publication_rights_gate.py` now scans `docs/` and `documentation/` roots, and includes `.html`, `.htm`, `.xhtml`, and `.xml` text surfaces in the fresh local license/reference scan.
+- `scripts/rebuild_indexes.py` now uses archive-local, no-symlink metadata readers for early JSON/hash reads that occur before the final full-tree index scan, preventing pre-scan reads through symlinked metadata paths.
+
+## New/updated evidence
+
+- `AUDIT/PUBLISH_QUEUE_ITEM_AUTHORIZED_SNAPSHOT_ENTRIES_REV0849.*`
+- `AUDIT/PUBLICATION_RIGHTS_GATE_HTML_DOCS_SCAN_REV0849.*`
+- `AUDIT/REBUILD_INDEXES_METADATA_READ_BOUNDARY_REV0849.*`
+- `scripts/validate_publish_queue_item_authorized_snapshot_entries_rev0849.py`
+- `scripts/validate_publication_rights_gate_html_docs_scan_rev0849.py`
+- `scripts/validate_rebuild_indexes_metadata_read_boundary_rev0849.py`
+- `VALIDATION/rev0849_targeted_validation.txt`
+
+## Publication status
+
+Publication remains blocked pending owner-approved root/component license and notice decisions. This revision hardens the future safe path; it does not declare or infer rights.
